Hi Karl,

Thanks a ton for taking a look.  No rush on my end.

If it would be helpful, I can share any intermediate files, or R code I used.  Outside of rQTL, I performed LD pruning in bcftools, and then used this MapRTools to compute recombination frequencies and LOD scores (`MLEL`; https://github.com/jendelman/MapRtools/blob/master/R/MLEL.R), and convert cM to map distances (`genetic_map`; https://github.com/jendelman/MapRtools/blob/master/R/genetic_map.R).

Thanks again,
Scott

